{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111506","id":2906452248,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6tPPEY","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111506","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111506.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111506.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111506","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111506/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111506/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111506/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/ec9fe547059b81bca5a0ed964fdf2a27641bbfae","number":111506,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"GDScript: Use named globals for extensions that can be unloaded","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The script language system has two kinds of globals:\r\n- globals registered using `add_named_global`. Those can be removed\r\n- globals registered using `add_global`. Those can't be removed.\r\n\r\nGDScript optimizes the access to the later by converting the name to an index that is embedded in the bytecode.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/93972 added extension unloading in the editor. For that it added code to remove globals added using `add_global`. However the way it was implemented meant that the index of those globals was not stable anymore. It also did not add any invalidation for scripts that embed the index in the bytecode. This could lead to issues were the index points to something else after reloading an extension.\r\n\r\nThis PR moves the editor editor extension loading to use `add_named_global`. This means the name is embedded in the bytecode, so reloading should be save.\r\n\r\nI also added some comments and docs to explain the difference between `add_named_global` and `add_global`.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg